During his reign,

282
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:41,670
planet Suzaku flourished.

283
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,910
Our sect's fourth ancestor

284
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,430
reached Ascendant

285
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:46,990
during that time.

286
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,990
What became of him ?

287
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,720
Thousands of years ago,

288
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:57,670
4 foreign cultivators invaded Suzaku.

289
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:01,400
The fourth ancestor fought alongside the second Suzaku.

290
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:03,950
Even if he won his duel,

291
00:15:04,680 --> 00:15:06,750
the fourth ancestor was badly wounded

292
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,750
and became the fourth primary soul.

293
00:15:09,160 --> 00:15:10,350
And the second Suzaku

294
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,230
disappeared.

295
00:15:15,280 --> 00:15:16,430
A mortal...

296
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:19,710
I waited thousands of years

297
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:22,070
just to get a mere mortal !

298
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:24,200
I can't even possess you !

299
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:25,950
According to Senior Du Tian,

300
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:27,840
this second Suzaku

301
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:29,910
sounds a lot like Situ Nan.

302
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:32,270
Is it really him ?

303
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:33,920
That's enough,

304
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:35,630
it's all in the past anyways.

305
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:38,470
The Suzaku Continent is ahead.

306
00:15:39,520 --> 00:15:41,030
What matters now,

307
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:43,880
is that we return to the Soul Refining Sect

308
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:45,720
for your Soul Transformation.

309
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:56,400
This formation's size

310
00:15:56,480 --> 00:15:57,390
is astonishing.

311
00:15:57,960 --> 00:16:00,830
Planet Suzaku's strongest formation,

312
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:02,590
the Suzaku Formation.

313
00:16:03,320 --> 00:16:04,470
When deployed

314
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:06,790
it can envelop the entire planet

315
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:09,800
or shrink to protect a single person.

316
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:11,440
It's incredibly powerful.

317
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:14,760
The amount of spirit stones needed to activate it

318
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:15,990
is unimaginable.

319
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:19,990
Zhuque Zi is sparing no expense in this war with

320
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:22,720
the Forsaken Immortal Clan.

321
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:35,440
This formation contains

322
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,830
Giant Demon blood !?

323
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:39,950
I remember now.

324
00:16:40,520 --> 00:16:42,110
That Qian Feng kid

325
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:43,950
visited the Giant Demon Clan.

326
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:47,440
He broke your seal on their cultivation

327
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:49,590
and moved them to Suzaku.

328
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:54,230
I wondered why they were so generous

329
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:57,550
but they were after their blood

330
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,910
to strengthen the formation.

331
00:17:00,680 --> 00:17:02,630
Qian Feng broke the seal

332
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:04,680
without me noticing ?

333
00:17:04,840 --> 00:17:06,720
He's not to be underestimated...

334
00:17:06,840 --> 00:17:08,320
Zhuque Zi,

335
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:10,710
open this formation for me !

336
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:13,760
Or I will risk my life

337
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:15,240
to blast open a gap

338
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:17,870
before the Forsaken Immortla Clan even arrives !

339
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:20,270
My patience is limited.

340
00:17:20,760 --> 00:17:21,680
Three...

341
00:17:22,760 --> 00:17:23,520
Two...

342
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,360
Senior, don't get angry.

343
00:17:26,360 --> 00:17:27,830
Junior will open it.

344
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:33,510
The Suzaku Formation

345
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:36,830
is only taught to Suzaku successors.

346
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:39,670
Since Zhuque Zi taught you early,

347
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:43,150
he must have high hopes for you.

348
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:47,720
You flatter me, Senior.

349
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:57,830
Junior means no harm.

350
00:17:59,040 --> 00:18:00,560
I merely wish to spar

351
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:02,390
with the famous Ceng Niu,

352
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:03,950
that's all.

353
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:06,390
Enough.

354
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:08,830
I don't have time to waste with you.

355
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:10,240
Could it be

356
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:12,230
that Senior's successor

357
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:15,910
lacks the courage to face me ?

358
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:16,870
Kid,

359
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:18,910
you're courting death !

360
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:20,230
Alright,

361
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:22,510
I'll fight you.

362
00:18:26,080 --> 00:21:02,390
After Du Tian told the story of the fourth ancestor and the second Suzaku fighting foreign cultivators, Wang Lin asks if he knows if any of these cultivators were by any chance named "Na Duo" (Wang Lin met Na Duo in episode 53).\N\N“That’s right, the ancestor recorded one of the names of the four foreign cultivators. That person said that he was from planet Five Elements and was called Na Duo. Yes, that should be correct. Once we go back, I’ll give you the jade with the records.”\N\N-> I think that the person that dueled the fourth ancestor was Na Duo. He was surprised by the Billion-Soul Flag combined with the fourth ancestor's Ascendant cultivation and was severly injured. That explains why he got hurt so badly and took thousands of years to recover 30% of his cultivation as a corpse in the War God Shrine.\N\NEven if this is the most likely scenario, it's also weird that someone as strong as Na Duo (whose cultivation at 100% is way past Ascendant) would lose to someone as weak as the fourth ancestor. Maybe he wasn't at 100% when he attacked planet Suzaku. Maybe I'm missing something. Maybe it's a plot hole.

363
00:18:43,330 --> 00:18:46,630
To let go of the consequences of my actions

364
00:18:46,630 --> 00:18:48,350
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

365
00:18:48,390 --> 00:18:50,290
like scattered ink.

366
00:18:51,170 --> 00:18:57,770
As destiny falls

367
00:18:54,010 --> 00:18:57,770
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

368
00:18:57,770 --> 00:19:05,370
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

369
00:19:01,010 --> 00:19:05,370
wither and melt into rivers.

370
00:19:05,810 --> 00:19:12,930
Who can deceive

371
00:19:08,570 --> 00:19:12,930
the law of the heavens ?

372
00:19:13,250 --> 00:19:16,250
Countless generations

373
00:19:14,530 --> 00:19:16,250
have tried before me.

374
00:19:16,540 --> 00:19:19,970
But how could I not catch my dreams

375
00:19:18,370 --> 00:19:19,970
within my warm fingers ?

376
00:19:20,530 --> 00:19:24,050
You're at my side when I'm alone

377
00:19:24,050 --> 00:19:27,370
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

378
00:19:28,130 --> 00:19:31,330
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

379
00:19:31,690 --> 00:19:35,530
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

380
00:19:33,530 --> 00:19:35,530
in the streets.

381
00:19:35,690 --> 00:19:40,490
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

382
00:19:37,250 --> 00:19:40,490
Can I break the rules ?

383
00:19:40,500 --> 00:19:43,210
To run towards you !

384
00:19:43,250 --> 00:19:46,530
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

385
00:19:46,530 --> 00:19:51,170
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

386
00:19:51,170 --> 00:19:54,570
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

387
00:19:54,610 --> 00:19:59,250
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

388
00:19:59,700 --> 00:20:04,930
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

389
00:20:05,050 --> 00:20:08,850
If your soul is willing to wander,

390
00:20:08,850 --> 00:20:13,490
can I still take your hands

391
00:20:10,530 --> 00:20:13,490
and hold them tight ?

392
00:20:13,650 --> 00:20:16,570
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

393
00:20:16,570 --> 00:20:21,450
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

394
00:20:21,460 --> 00:20:24,730
I dream of destroying

395
00:20:24,890 --> 00:20:29,450
the shackles of our fate.

396
00:20:29,450 --> 00:20:33,410
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

397
00:20:33,410 --> 00:20:36,210
You're the hardest to let go of.

398
00:20:36,290 --> 00:20:40,090
I want to be with you again

399
00:20:40,170 --> 00:20:43,450
so I can look in your eyes.

400
00:20:43,730 --> 00:20:48,690
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
